---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Yu Zhehao" active="about" description="About Yu Zhehao, interests in theoretical physics, mathematics and AI.">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <p class="page-kicker">ABOUT / YU ZHEHAO</p>
      <h1 class="page-title" data-zh="让好奇心长成结构。" data-en="Let curiosity take structure.">让好奇心长成结构。</h1>
      <p class="page-lead" data-zh="我对理论物理、数学与人工智能抱有长期兴趣，尤其关注数学结构如何帮助我们理解基本物理。" data-en="I have a long-term interest in theoretical physics, mathematics and artificial intelligence, especially in how mathematical structures can illuminate fundamental physics.">我对理论物理、数学与人工智能抱有长期兴趣，尤其关注数学结构如何帮助我们理解基本物理。</p>
    </header>
    <section class="section-block prose">
      <h2 data-zh="研究兴趣" data-en="Research interests">研究兴趣</h2>
      <p>My interests move between quantum field theory, geometry, number theory and scientific computation. I am particularly interested in Feynman integrals and periods: how graph topology gives rise to geometric structures, how those structures can be detected and classified, and how they return to physical quantities after renormalization.</p>
      <p>我也关注 AI 是否能够成为严肃科学研究中的工具：不仅生成猜想，更要帮助建立可验证的推导、可复现的实验和独立的计算证书。</p>
      <h2 data-zh="研究原则" data-en="Research principles">研究原则</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>区分定理、条件性结论、数值证据、猜想与尚未解决的问题。</li>
        <li>优先给出可复核的定义、推导、代码与数据来源。</li>
        <li>让计算服务于数学和物理问题，而不是用计算结果替代证明。</li>
        <li>保持开放：允许失败、修正和版本化记录。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="section-block feature-panel">
      <p class="page-kicker">CONTACT / COLLABORATION</p>
      <h2 data-zh="保持好奇，保持联系。" data-en="Stay curious. Stay in touch.">保持好奇，保持联系。</h2>
      <p data-zh="欢迎交流数学、物理、AI 与科学计算相关的问题。" data-en="Open to conversations about mathematics, physics, AI and scientific computing.">欢迎交流数学、物理、AI 与科学计算相关的问题。</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/Ynotfound" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
